.txt","ext":".txt","name":"agent's notes (facts it saw, not a verdict)","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":2250},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"b149951c2a985937e9981b055a64aa3c","originalFileName":"62227672-d553-42a2-94f2-6983ca5fc190-attachment.json","ext":".json","name":"oracle verdict","contentType":"application/json","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":4486},"type":"attachment"}],"error":{"message":"Checked by Quinn's runner (ledger.md #23): Fail (S07 only, product — cluster C1) — S07: NH search for 'hip fracture' matches the resident by diagnosis (should say No residents match); search hint offers 'diagnosis'. S17 (search across mode switches), S20 (retype/clear/spaces) pass"},"testCase":{"id":"bf9b96d6c728ba9262d13167d7beef53","externalId":"7978570b6ab9fb317fc89035dbc7f756","name":"[dev] S17 Switch context with a search in progress: each list refuses the other context's names and MRN","fullName":"TC-03 Search & Sort › TC-03/S17"},"descriptionHtml":"<div class=\"rc-approach\"><p><b>Approach</b> · TC-03 Search &amp; Sort · <b>S17</b> Switch context with a search in progress: each list refuses the other context's names and MRN</p><p><b>UAT steps / ticket ACs covered:</b></p><ul><li><b>U1</b> Hospital: search by name, by room, by MRN and by diagnosis each returns the correct matching patients, each field on its own. (UAT TC-03; TFA-92581 AC 2; TFA-92581 AC 5)</li><li><b>U4</b> Nursing Home: search by name, by unit/room, by MRN and by facility each returns the correct matching residents, each field on its own. (UAT TC-03; TFA-92581 AC 3; TFA-92581 AC 6)</li></ul><p><b>Test design technique: </b>State transition (state-transition) — Go through the steps in order (add → edit → delete, day 1 → day 2, offline → online) and check the state after each step.</p><p><b>Given </b>Standard fixture</p><p><b>When </b>Hospital: search 'QA Hosp', then 'QA Resident'. Switch to Nursing Home and note the resident's MRN from the card. Search 'QA Hosp' there. Switch back to Hospital. Search 'QA Resident', then the resident's MRN</p><p><b>Then </b>Hospital never lists the resident, even when searched by the resident's name or MRN, before or after a switch. Nursing Home never lists the Hospital patient, even when searched by its name. Each such search says nothing matches</p><p><b>Pass rule (oracle, excerpt): </b>oracle.mjs: cp1 mustContain {hospitalPatient}, mustNotContain {snfResident}. cp2, cp6 and cp7 mustContain 'No patients match', mustNotContain {snfResident}. cp3 mustContain 'heading &quot;Nursing Home&quot;' and {snfResident}, mustNotContain {hospitalPatient}. cp4 mustContain 'No residents match', mustNotContain {hospitalPatient}. …</p><p><b>Where it ran: </b>dev unit U23; test method AGENT · Browser agent; lane planned in the matrix: browser agent (automated)</p><p><small>S17 is our own case number (its number in the coverage matrix cases/TC-03.matrix.json), not a step number of the UAT document.</small></p></div><p><b>Environment: dev</b> — dev deployment, build <code>e02167f</code> (Deploy Convex, 2026-10-12T18:24:27Z); account and address are not written into the report; run folder <code>runs/2026-10-14-dev</code>.</p><p><b>Test method:</b> AGENT · Browser agent — as classified in cases/test-methods.json, which says it runs on both; Source: <code>dev</code>.</p><p><b>UAT item:</b> TC-03 Search &amp; Sort · <b>Section:</b> A1 · Home Screen &amp; Dashboard · <b>Scenario:</b> TC-03/S17</p><p><b>Switch context with a search in progress: each list refuses the other context's names and MRN</b></p><p><b>Tickets:</b> TFA-92581 Search &amp; Sort (ready for qa)</p><p><b>Result:</b> Pass from <code>scripts/oracle.mjs</code> on the saved evidence (<code>units/U23.verdict.json</code>), unit U23 split by its parts' checkpoints. Agent: 88 turns, 263 s, $0.60.</p><p><b>Plan:</b> unit U23 (#23, ready-for-qa, ui-only) — Search box, both contexts. Same legacy seed, same search box, read-only typing (diagnosis words, names / MRN across contexts, fast re-type and whitespace). No part opens a chart or changes a row. Runs together with TC-03/S07, TC-03/S20.</p><p><b>Checked by Quinn's runner</b> (<code>ledger.md</code> #23, U23; checked: yes): <b>Fail (S07 only, product — cluster C1)</b> — S07: NH search for 'hip fracture' matches the resident by diagnosis (should say No residents match); search hint offers 'diagnosis'. S17 (search across mode switches), S20 (retype/clear/spaces) pass</p>","environment":"default","setup":[],"teardown":[],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["TC-03 Search & Sort","S17 Switch context with a search in progress: each list refuses the other context's names and MRN"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":[],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"id":"af8af6f9461906f26624b9e8fc41cfae","originalFileName":"f5d8ece5-0571-4f58-b692-d940bdbc1fae-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":2610},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"55b6ae1e071851081a3d238cfa0e8532","originalFileName":"ece6850d-3224-4dfd-bb59-b9d9538f3275-attachment.png","ext":".png","name":"screenshot","contentType":"image/png","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":75600},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"b063dfe7b93b76eb3cd9aae10c3bcea1","originalFileName":"522ecd34-9e89-4bfe-9880-c2d3e7e6b2f8-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":1976},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"7f811045c45619c9d280178b5e7d1d6a","originalFileName":"a9b53ff5-1490-4b19-82d0-0540c7f72cf1-attachment.png","ext":".png","name":"screenshot","contentType":"image/png","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":66830},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"37fc066499eb05f49c0bb451c5bed29d","originalFileName":"0513ebf6-9879-4718-9054-c68159c37f28-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"te